Package: openfield
Title: Open Field Test Analysis and Plot
Description: Analyzes and plots Open Field Test outcomes. This is a fundamental behavioral test used for studying psychiatric disorders (e.g., anxiety, PTSD) in animal models (i.e., rats and mice). The package is able to automatically analyze and plot: 1. time spent in the center of the arena; 2. thigmotaxis; 3. freezing; 4. rearing behavior.
Version: 1.0
Encoding: UTF-8
